I believe in God,\nthe Father Almighty,\:
Ninyikiriza omuri Ruhanga,
Isheboona ow'amaani goona,
Omutonzi w'eiguru n'ensi,
kandi na Yesu Kristo, Omwana we wenka, Mukama waitu,
owaateekateekirwe omu maani g'Omwoyo Orikwera,
akazaarwa Omukazi Mariamu,
yabonabona ahansi ya Pontius Pilate,
yakomererwa aha musaraba, yafa kandi yaaziikwa;
akashuuma omu bafu;
aha eizooba rya kashatu akagaruka yaazooka kuruga omu bafu;
akatemba omu iguru,
kandi ashutami aha mukono gwa buryo gwa Ruhanga Isheboona ow'amaani goona;
kuruga aho naija kwija kucwera abahuriire hamwe n'abafiire.
